ing the truth."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Louis c'est ce mec super gentil. Et dans son cabinet d'avocat, ce n'est pas un compliment. Le jour où son médecin lui diagnostique par erreur une maladie grave, le regard des autres change : on fait attention à lui, on lui pose des questions et on écoute les réponses, Louis existe enfin ! Alors bien évidemment, il hésite à dire qu'il va très bien."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pnjoKaBUTyJSIqbOLQNTUCge9eE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kIrboYJcV9fgvLLXOM9daBowLqI.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1004255,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pnjoKaBUTyJSIqbOLQNTUCge9eE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pnjoKaBUTyJSIqbOLQNTUCge9eE.jpg","language":"it","width":930,"height":1395},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pnjoKaBUTyJSIqbOLQNTUCge9eE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pnjoKaBUTyJSIqbOLQNTUCge9eE.jpg","language":"it","width":930,"height":1395},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lKNoiXmCMj18PZ0LYrYzsf6Mdrv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lKNoiXmCMj18PZ0LYrYzsf6Mdrv.jpg","language":"it","width":1429,"height":2143}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qH8p6c3P7wruLcckGpxdoA0BrKG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qH8p6c3P7wruLcckGpxdoA0BrKG.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qH8p6c3P7wruLcckGpxdoA0BrKG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qH8p6c3P7wruLcckGpxdoA0BrKG.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000